{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07320","headline":"湖南使还留辞辛大夫 · 刘长卿","name":"湖南使还留辞辛大夫","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"王师劳近甸，兵食仰诸侯。\n天子无南顾，元勳在上游。\n大才生间气，盛业拯横流。\n风景随摇笔，山川入运筹。\n羽觞交饯席，旄节对归舟。\n莺识春深恨，猿知日去愁。\n别离花寂寂，南北水悠悠。\n唯有家兼国，终身共所忧。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘长卿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07320.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07320","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}